{"id": "UgyEZcuIZ4lAmfz6ttd4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 7, "text": "This is some of the best music I've ever heard-it all rhymes, it is all cafe-related, and the cool vibe is insanely funky, yet chill. Every song hits just right! And they all make me smile and chuckle because everything they're saying lyric-wise is spot on when you're sitting in a café!! I love ALL the songs, but I think \"20-minute cake decision\" resonates with me the most, because that is TOTALLY me trying to decide which one I want to savor the most! Lol!!!😂😂 I just love the beat, the lyrics, and the vibe of all of them! \"Pretending to work\" is awesome, too cuz we all know damn good and well that over half the folks sitting in cafes are just pretending to work!!! So it's totally true!!!😂😂😂😂❤❤❤❤❤❤\nThank you so much for this fantastic compilation, please keep up the good work!\nHave a wonderful week!!!!❤❤❤❤❤❤❤❤❤❤❤❤", "published": "2026-05-26T22:39:00", "replies": 2, "creator": false}
